1
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:07,359
Chapter 18.

2
00:00:08,139 --> 00:00:13,899
The little prince crossed the desert and met with only one flower.

3
00:00:13,899 --> 00:00:21,179
It was a flower with three petals, a flower of no account at all.

4
00:00:21,399 --> 00:00:26,100
"Good morning," said the little prince.

5
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:31,560
"Good morning," said the flower.

6
00:00:32,319 --> 00:00:34,300
"Where are the men?"

7
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,479
the little prince asked, politely.

8
00:00:37,479 --> 00:00:42,960
The flower had once seen a caravan passing

9
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,439
man she echoed.

10
00:00:47,439 --> 00:00:53,619
"I think there are six or seven of them in existence.

11
00:00:53,619 --> 00:00:58,420
I saw them, several years ago.

12
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:02,679
But one never knows where to find them.

13
00:01:02,679 --> 00:01:07,020
The wind blows them away.

14
00:01:07,119 --> 00:01:17,619
They have no roots, and that makes their life very difficult."

15
00:01:18,698 --> 00:01:23,698
"Goodbye," said the little prince.

16
00:01:24,279 --> 00:01:29,939
"Goodbye," said the flower
